  "policies": [
    {
      "topic": "shipping",
      "title": "Shipping",
      "text": "Orders are packed within 1-2 business days and ship from Portland, Oregon. US Standard (USPS Ground Advantage) takes 3-6 business days and costs $6.95, free on orders of $60 or more after discounts. US Express (UPS 2nd Day Air) is $14.95. We ship to Canada and the United Kingdom (7-14 business days, $18; import duties and taxes are paid by the customer on delivery). We do not currently ship to other countries. Tracking is emailed when the label is created."
    },
    {
      "topic": "returns",
      "title": "Returns & refunds",
      "text": "Unused, unburned items can be returned within 30 days of delivery. Start a return by replying to your order confirmation email; the customer pays return shipping unless we made a mistake. Refunds go to the original payment method within 5 business days after we receive the return. Burned candles can't be returned unless they are defective (for example a wick that won't stay lit). Gift cards are non-refundable."
    },
    {
      "topic": "damaged",
      "title": "Damaged or wrong items",
      "text": "If something arrives broken or we sent the wrong item, send a photo within 7 days of delivery and we will ship a free replacement or refund it - a team member reviews every claim. You don't need to return broken glass."
    },
    {
      "topic": "order-changes",
      "title": "Changing or cancelling an order",
      "text": "We can change the address or cancel an order until it has been packed, usually within 24 hours of ordering. A team member has to make the change, so reply as soon as possible. Once a shipping label exists we can't reroute the parcel, but the carrier may offer redirect options."
    },
    {
      "topic": "discounts",
      "title": "Discount codes",
      "text": "WELCOME10 gives 10% off a first order. Only one code can be used per order, and codes don't apply to gift cards. FALL15 was an autumn 2025 promotion and has expired."
    },
    {
      "topic": "wholesale",
      "title": "Wholesale",
      "text": "Retailers can apply at /pages/wholesale. Opening orders have a $250 minimum; reorders have a $150 minimum. Wholesale pricing is 50% off retail. Payment is by card for the first two orders, then net-30 terms are available."
    },
    {
      "topic": "candle-care",
      "title": "Candle care & safety",
      "text": "Trim the wick to 1/4 inch before every burn. Burn for 2-3 hours the first time, until the melted wax reaches the edge, to prevent tunnelling. Don't burn for more than 4 hours at a time and never leave a candle unattended. Our fragrance oils are phthalate-free and our wax is vegan; we never test on animals. If you have pets or allergies, burn in a ventilated room and ask your vet or doctor about specific ingredients."
    },
    {
      "topic": "gifts",
      "title": "Gift orders",
      "text": "Tick 'This is a gift' at checkout to add a free gift note; gift orders ship without prices on the packing slip. Gift wrap is not available. Digital gift cards are delivered by email and never expire."
    }
  ],
